      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm kinda freaking out a bit. my left calf has been all swollen and really sore for a couple days now, and now i'm having this weird tightness in my chest and it's getting hard to catch my breath. i'm feeling super lightheaded too. do u think i'm just having a panic attack? i've been so stressed lately...",
